1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:08,690
Today increasing importance is being attached to cultivating college students’ team spirit.
如今，培养大学生的团队精神越来越受到重视。

2
00:00:09,490 --> 00:00:18,860
In modern society, many major tasks, from scientific research to business projects, are too complex for any individual to complete alone.
在现代社会，许多重大任务，从科学研究到商业项目，都过于复杂，任何个人都无法独自完成。

3
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:25,900
As a result, employers now value the ability to cooperate as highly as professional knowledge.
因此，用人单位如今把合作能力看得和专业知识同样重要。

4
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:29,310
Team spirit benefits students in many ways.
团队精神在许多方面让学生受益。

5
00:00:30,110 --> 00:00:37,500
When working in a team, they learn to communicate clearly, listen to different views and make the most of each member’s strengths.
在团队中工作时，他们学会清楚地沟通、倾听不同的观点，并充分发挥每个成员的长处。

6
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:41,920
They also learn to put the common goal above personal interests.
他们还学会把共同目标置于个人利益之上。

7
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:47,540
Last year, I took part in a business plan competition with four classmates.
去年，我和四位同学一起参加了一场商业计划大赛。

8
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:58,420
At first we argued constantly, but once we divided the work according to what each of us did best, our efficiency improved greatly and we finally won second place.
起初我们不停地争论，但当我们按照每个人最擅长的事情分工之后，效率大大提高，最终获得了第二名。

9
00:00:59,220 --> 00:01:04,340
That experience taught me that a team can achieve far more than its members working separately.
那次经历让我明白，一个团队所能取得的成就远远超过其成员各自为战时的成就。

10
00:01:05,140 --> 00:01:12,270
To cultivate team spirit, colleges can assign more group projects and encourage students to join clubs and sports teams.
为了培养团队精神，高校可以布置更多的小组项目，并鼓励学生加入社团和运动队。

11
00:01:13,070 --> 00:01:19,980
Students themselves should be willing to share responsibilities, respect their teammates and handle disagreements calmly.
学生自己则应当乐于分担责任、尊重队友，并冷静地处理分歧。

12
00:01:20,780 --> 00:01:26,370
Those who learn to cooperate in college will be well prepared to succeed in their future careers.
在大学里学会合作的人，将为在未来的职业生涯中取得成功做好充分准备。
